        "t": 463.64,
        "r": 293.6349999999999,
        "b": 446.0321008403361
      },
      "content": "Perform the procedures on page 4-2, 'Remove Outer Door Panel' prior to performing the following steps.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_979",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_24",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_24",
